D[6053]={"^Increases your chance to block by (.-)%% and increases the Armor contribution from your shield by (.-)%%, but your damage dealt is reduced by (.-)%%%.%s*$","Aumenta sua chance de {{1}}% bloquear e aumenta a contribuição de armadura de seu escudo em {{2}}%, mas reduz o dano que causa em {{3}}%."}
