D[12245]={"^You are infused with the blood of the Vampyr Queen%. Damage done increased by 100%%%.\nAttacks heal caster%.%s*$","Está injetado com a sangue dá Rainha Vampyr. O dano causado aumenta em 100%.\nOs ataques curam o conjurador."}
